  "heading": "§ 348.02 Frontage Features",
  "html": "<div class=\"Section toc-destination rbox\" id=\"rid-0-0-0-45110\" style=\"margin-top: .5rem\"><h6><a id=\"JD_348.02\" name=\"JD_348.02\" title=\"348.02\"></a>§ 348.02  Frontage Features</h6></div><div class=\"rbox Normal-Level\" id=\"rid-0-0-0-45109\"><div>   One of the following features shall be required on principal street frontages:</div></div><div class=\"rbox Normal-Level\" id=\"rid-0-0-0-45108\"><div>   Porch<br/>   Terrace or lightwell<br/>   Forecourt<br/>   Stoop; twelve (12) sq. ft. min.<br/>   Shopfront<br/>   Gallery; eight (8) ft. min. depth<br/>   Arcade; eight (8) ft. min. depth</div></div><div class=\"rbox Normal-Level\" id=\"rid-0-0-0-45106\"><div><div style=\"text-align:center;\"><span class=\"img\"><span>[IMAGE]</span></span></div></div></div><div class=\"rbox Normal-Level\" id=\"rid-0-0-0-41511\"><div><div style=\"text-align:center;\">[<a class=\"Data\" href=\"https://export.amlegal.com/media/32eb4da1492d2ce5e4435e569daed30a1af89a42/DATAOBJECTS/0-0-0-13294.pdf\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Document Link (opens in new tab)\">Click here to view a printable PDF version</a>]</div></div></div><div class=\"rbox Normal-Level\" id=\"rid-0-0-0-41506\"><div>(Ord. No. 364-16. Passed 5-2-16, eff. 5-4-16)</div></div>",
