  "text": "§ 348.02 Frontage Features\nOne of the following features shall be required on principal street frontages:\nPorch\nTerrace or lightwell\nForecourt\nStoop; twelve (12) sq. ft. min.\nShopfront\nGallery; eight (8) ft. min. depth\nArcade; eight (8) ft. min. depth\n[IMAGE]\n[Click here to view a printable PDF version]\n(Ord. No. 364-16. Passed 5-2-16, eff. 5-4-16)",
